  state: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cfdf78d49cfb8534eb01e4b3b2ed32a0, type: 2}
  isAutomatic: 0
  ChangeTimeOfAction: 0
  Text: "Boy, is this guy shaky! His name is <link>Sergio Raracara</link>. \n\nHe
    knows who we work for, so no need to worry about him squealing. \n\nIt happened
    like this: Out of nowhere, while he was \"driving his own business\", <link>the
    BIGGEST cow he has ever seen</link> jumped at full cow-speed in front of the
    truck. \n\nWhen he came to on the road, the cow was no more, the truck was lodged,
    and the <link>cargo</link> doors were slightly open. He tried to shut them without
    looking inside, but he finally gave up and hid. \n\nHe doesn't know what he stepped
    on."
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
